## Scope of your edits

Touch only the code the {% if planned %}plan{% else %}design{% endif %} describes, plus the log. Comments state what
the code currently does, tersely: never a reference to a design document,
delta or any document that will not outlive the task, never a note about what
the code used to do. That is a standing project standard; a reviewer flagging
such a comment is right, and the disposition is to fix it.

